<title>USA: LaserVision system gets premarket nod.</title>
<headline>LaserVision system gets premarket nod.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaserVision Centers Inc said on Tuesday it received notification that the Food and Drug Administration granted its premarket approval application on the company's Visx Excimer Laser System Model C.</p>
<p>The company said it would immediately submit a premarket supplement for approval to use the system in its MobilExcimer units.</p>
</text>
